WEBVTT

00:03:29.163 --> 00:03:32.829
but just as real, just as deadly.

00:03:32.829 --> 00:03:34.496
Add an epic pandemic

00:03:34.538 --> 00:03:37.371
and this year,
for the first time in 20 years,

00:03:37.371 --> 00:03:40.538
global extreme poverty
is projected to rise,

00:03:40.579 --> 00:03:42.704
and global human development,

00:03:42.746 --> 00:03:46.454
a measure of the world's education,
health and living standards,

00:03:46.496 --> 00:03:48.538
is set to decline for the first time

00:03:48.579 --> 00:03:51.454
since the measure began 30 years ago.

00:03:52.288 --> 00:03:55.413
COVID-19 has not changed the future yet,

00:03:55.454 --> 00:03:59.079
but it has revealed
these deep flaws in our present

00:03:59.121 --> 00:04:00.538
bringing clarity to the fact